  "location": "weights repository at the pinned revision, synthetic/gen_v7h_f0.55/: the SHA-256-pinned training set of the Development-phase MAST network; train.py --stage mast --synthetic <dir> installs it after a SHA-256 check. Without --synthetic (the default) the generator regenerates the set (H100 829 s, README.md \"Compute\"); on A100 hardware (in our Python 3.11.10 / torch 2.13.0+cu126 pods) that default route trains the shipped network mast/n7h_f0.55 (model.pt SHA-256 bfbb346c713310754deceffe460d2487c31b407db5818fe13c39b2d4a34d22e3) bit for bit (A100-SXM4 and A100 80GB PCIe), while training on the pinned set gave a different network in our A100 test (README.md \"Expected rebuild variance\")"
 },
